{"c":[{"name":"20261021T211831Z-daa0544e233ebf48","text":"Growth test asserts used blocks or a high-water of one index over the start, every cycle. No checkpoint while the HNSW index is down; the next cycle reclaims that free copy. Operator 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T213401Z-eb3da00d50779e55","text":"HNSW stays down until every embedding delete in the process has run, then one recreate. A recreate between two deletes leaks a used copy on DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Operator 2026-10-21.","type":"note"}]}
